5,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I'm looking forward to working with you all. To make sure we choose a sustainable program, I'd like to look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and visit completion on the shared nursing round.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure we are building on evidence of what actually works for our patients, I will look into the readmission figures during the call-back trial and what the booking system records.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I believe we need to consider the impact on our staff. I will look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I agree that we need a logical approach. To understand the actual financial viability and potential returns, I will look into this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to meet you all. I want to ensure our hospital can comfortably accommodate a new program, so I will look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It seems we have a very comprehensive plan. I appreciate how everyone is looking at this from different angles, from staffing to finance. Does anyone feel we are missing a critical piece of information?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we have covered the essential bases. By combining our findings on staffing, finance, and patient outcomes, we should have a clear picture of which program is truly viable.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. As long as we share our findings honestly, we can avoid placing an unfair burden on any specific department. I'm interested to see if the staffing levels align with the proposed programs.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Honesty is fine, but let's not forget that ""viability"" is often a matter of numbers, not just feelings. I'm curious to see if the budget actually supports the ambitions of the proposals.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Shion. We must be practical. It would be a shame to choose a wonderful program only to find our patients cannot reach us or we have no room to welcome them.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree completely. It's important that we don't let our enthusiasm blind us to the practicalities. I'm glad we're all on the same page about being thorough before we move to the voting stage.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. A balanced perspective is our best tool here. I look forward to seeing how the data from our various inquiries aligns once we have the results.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree. I think it's best if we all focus on our chosen areas for now. I'll be waiting to see how the staffing data compares to the needs of the candidates.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,Indeed. Let's stop talking in circles and get to the data. I'm sure the ledger will tell a far more honest story than any proposal document. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us proceed and see what we find. I hope the information helps us make a choice that is kind to both our staff and our patients. See you all soon.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's move forward and gather the facts. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
