61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"Looking at the options, A and C involve off-site work or outside coordination, which we know is risky. B requires therapy staff we lack. D uses the midwifery slack and stays on-site. I vote for D.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Midori, I agree. While A aligns with the success of the call-back trial, the lack of funding for off-site work and the nursing vacancies make it unsustainable. D is the most viable choice. I vote for D.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, @Jonathan, I agree. A and B are impossible given the nursing vacancies and the loss of physiotherapists. D utilizes the midwifery slack without overstretching our burdened teams. I vote for D.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shion,,The conclusion is obvious. A and C are financial voids due to the off-site tariff issue. B is a staffing impossibility. D is the only option that is fiscally sound and utilizes available resources. I vote for D.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with you all. A and B would be too taxing on our staff, and C seems complex. D uses the available slack and keeps patients on-site. I vote for D.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"It is rare that we all agree so quickly, but the data makes the choice clear. D is the only option that respects our budget, our space, and our staff's well-being.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
67,3,2,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
68,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. When the evidence on staffing and funding is this stark, the most compassionate choice is also the most practical one. D is the only sustainable path forward.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
69,3,2,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
70,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It is a relief that we found a solution that doesn't place an unfair burden on the nursing or therapy teams. D is the only responsible choice.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
71,3,2,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
72,3,2,talk,Shion,,"It's a rare moment of total consensus, but it's simply the only logical outcome. We've stripped away the fantasies and left the only viable reality. D is the only choice.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
73,3,2,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
74,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree. It is a comfort to know we have found a way to help our new parents without overwhelming our dear staff or our crowded halls. I am happy to vote for D.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
